00:41:58,550 --> 00:42:00,790
But it is a real phenomena that does

976
00:42:00,790 --> 00:42:03,470
exist in the right conditions.

977
00:42:03,470 --> 00:42:05,788
So don't worry if you don't see it in your graphs.

978
00:42:05,788 --> 00:42:07,330
You might just be out in this regime,

979
00:42:07,330 --> 00:42:08,830
or you might have other effects that

980
00:42:08,830 --> 00:42:10,210
