1031
00:44:19,842 --> 00:44:22,260
Yes, it's exactly at the interpolation threshold.

1032
00:44:22,260 --> 00:44:24,880
And you can show these things for linear models,

1033
00:44:24,880 --> 00:44:26,160
and it's all provable.

1034
00:44:26,160 --> 00:44:28,205
But for deep nets, it's just empirical.

1035
00:44:28,205 --> 00:44:30,580
Let me keep going, and we can come back to more questions

1036
00:44:30,580 --> 00:44:31,340
later.

1037
00:44:31,340 --> 00:44:34,140
So how should we measure complexity?

1038
00:44:34,140 --> 00:44:37,810
So number of neurons, number of weights, number of parameters?

